The native text editor in rust/native/src/input.rs adapts GPUI's input
example from:
https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/blob/e231594b6b8818ea8d668ee2eb73e1fb09300654/crates/gpui/examples/input.rs

GPUI is authored by Nathan Sobo and contributors and distributed under
Apache License 2.0. Its license and the adaptation notice are retained in
rust/native/LICENSE-APACHE and rust/native/NOTICE. The upstream GPUI
license identifies Copyright 2022 - 2025 Zed Industries, Inc.

This adaptation adds bridge events, versioned Go snapshot synchronization,
disabled fields, input size limits, and horizontal caret scrolling.

